    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="20.3">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIAs">II As</ref> 20.3</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Ond beode mon on þam gemote, ðæt mon eal friþige, þæt se cyng friþian wille; ⁊ forgá þyfðe be his feore ⁊ be eallum þam þe he age.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And it shall be proclaimed in the assembly, that men shall respect everything which the king wishes to be respected, and refrain from theft on pain of death and [the loss of] all they possess.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ beode man on þæm gemot, þæt mon friþige eall þæt se cyng friþian wille; ⁊ forga ðyfþa be his feore ⁊ be eallum ðæm ðe he age.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
